  "contract": "A run's description after more than 64 updates (published Server 2.11.5 WorkflowController describe with Workflow 2.15.1 RunWaitView), over raw worker HTTP on protocol 1.20 in a fresh namespace. Published PHP bounds only pending updates (DW_V2_LIMIT_PENDING_UPDATES, 500 by default), not how many a run takes over its life, and describes a run by its open waits. A run waiting for a signal takes 65 updates, each accepted and completed by its workflow task, and is still described as waiting for that signal. A 66th update left accepted is described as the run's open update. Embedded applications have no worker protocol.",
